.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pgloupe-stats-diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
pgloupe\-stats\-diff \- Compare two snapshot CSV exports and rank the queries that changed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpgloupe stats diff\fR [\fB\-\-before\-info\fR] [\fB\-\-after\-info\fR] [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-top\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-calls\fR] [\fB\-\-wide\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBEFORE\fR> <\fIAFTER\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare two snapshot CSV exports and rank the queries that changed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-before\-info\fR \fI<BEFORE_INFO>\fR
`pg_stat_statements_info` CSV taken with the older snapshot
.TP
\fB\-\-after\-info\fR \fI<AFTER_INFO>\fR
`pg_stat_statements_info` CSV taken with the newer snapshot
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<BY>\fR [default: total]
Metric that orders the table
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
total: Δ total execution time
.IP \(bu 2
calls: Δ calls
.IP \(bu 2
mean: Mean execution time inside the window
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-top\fR \fI<TOP>\fR [default: 20]
Rows to show (`all` for every statement)
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-calls\fR \fI<MIN_CALLS>\fR [default: 1]
With `\-\-by mean`, skip queries with fewer calls than this in the window
.TP
\fB\-\-wide\fR
Show full query text in the table
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIBEFORE\fR>
Older snapshot: CSV export of `pg_stat_statements`
.TP
<\fIAFTER\fR>
Newer snapshot
